**Profile**: Title: Penitent's End, Origin: Rinascita.

{{Location Tabs|Penitent's End|Interactive Map}}
{{Intro/Location|Penitent's End}} This forsaken island, shrouded in dense sea mist, is dominated by steep cliffs with giant ringed structures. Ships caught in the currents often end up stranded on the island's treacherous shores. For those lucky enough to survive the wreck, even greater horrors await...

It is the destination of the [[Pilgrim's Sail]], as well as the home of the [[Troupe of Fools]].

